// Enemy moves for WP-037 (the Foundry Smith). Registry numbers 8660-8662. Schema:
// crates/content/src/moves.rs. Every attack telegraphs for at least 12 frames before its
// first active hitbox frame or projectile (docs/game/05-enemies-and-bosses.md, "Enemy
// roster"; checked by the validator). Damage comes from the enemy's `attack` in
// enemies/*.ron, so `motion_value` is the only multiplier here. Numbers are tuning.
#![enable(implicit_some)]
[
  (
    // A hammer slam. A second Fire hitbox stays up in front of it for 3 seconds as the burning metal it leaves (one strike per target).
